{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣男神許光漢在韓國人氣勁爆，今日有韓媒爆料指他最近與韓國人氣女團TWICE成員定延合作，在歌手matt matt新歌《nevermind》的MV中扮演情侶，而MV被影片等級委員會評為15歲以上人士可觀看的等級，暫時未知影片何時公開。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:39:54.148861+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T03:28:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T03:33:15.433686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:33:15.433686+00:00","content_hash":"c98bde43b6b284d0f952c3192814f002b71f5ead64b47b2bf54c7c5b4ec5fe04","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}